<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Datasets and Models Details</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix section provides complete information about the datasets and models used in our experimental evaluation of the SHALLOW benchmark framework. Tables <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix A Datasets and Models Details ‣ Hallucination Benchmark for Speech Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> and <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.1 Datasets ‣ Appendix A Datasets and Models Details ‣ Hallucination Benchmark for Speech Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> summarize the key characteristics of the datasets and models, respectively.</p>
</div>
